---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const problems=[["Manual work keeps multiplying","Data is copied between forms, spreadsheets, and systems that never stay in sync."],["Follow-up depends on memory","Requests, customers, and important tasks have no visible next step."],["Information is hard to turn into decisions","Reports arrive late or take hours of manual preparation."]];
const solutions=[["Process automation","Connect recurring tasks, approvals, follow-up, and reporting so work keeps moving.","/en/solutions/automation"],["AI agents","Voice and text agents that collect information, handle requests, and perform tasks within defined boundaries.","/en/solutions/ai-agents"],["Software and integrations","Applications and integrations that connect the data and tools your company already uses.","/en/solutions/software-and-integrations"]];
const steps=[["01","Assess","Map processes, friction, tools, and priorities."],["02","Prioritize","Separate real opportunities from ideas that do not justify investment yet."],["03","Design","Define the workflow, controls, and technology required."],["04","Implement","Build, test, train, and measure with real usage."]];
---
<BaseLayout title="Automation, AI, and software for modern companies" description="We examine how your team operates, find where time is lost, and design automation, AI agents, and software that improve productivity without adding operational complexity." locale="en" path="en">
<section class="hero-orchestration"><div class="dawn-stage" aria-hidden="true"><div class="dawn-halo dawn-halo-amber"></div><div class="dawn-halo dawn-halo-larimar"></div><div class="dawn-beam"></div><div class="dawn-grain"></div></div><div class="container"><div class="hero-support" style="--hero-delay:.02s"><span class="eyebrow">Automation, AI, and software for modern companies</span></div><h1 class="kinetic-heading" aria-label="Your business does not need more tools. It needs the right ones working together."><span class="kinetic-mask"><span class="kinetic-primary">Your business does not need more tools.</span></span><span class="kinetic-secondary" aria-hidden="true">{["It","needs","the","right","ones","working","together."].map((word,i)=><span class="kinetic-mask"><span class="kinetic-word" style={`--word-index:${i};--word-direction:${i%2===0?-1:1}`}>{word}</span></span>)}</span></h1><p class="hero-lede hero-support" style="--hero-delay:.6s">We examine how your team operates, find where time is lost, and design automation, AI agents, and software that improve productivity without adding operational complexity.</p><div class="hero-actions hero-support" style="--hero-delay:.72s"><a class="button button-primary button-lg" href="/en/assessment/now">Start my assessment now</a><a class="button button-outline" href="/en/assessment/schedule">Schedule my assessment</a></div><div class="hero-notes hero-support" style="--hero-delay:.82s">{["Free initial assessment","Available in English and Spanish","Immediate preliminary summary"].map(note=><span class="hero-note"><svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>{note}</span>)}</div><div class="system-flow" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="system-flow-lines" viewBox="0 0 1000 150" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M110 28 C160 95 360 84 500 124"/><path d="M500 28 C500 68 500 88 500 124"/><path d="M890 28 C840 95 640 84 500 124"/><circle class="flow-signal flow-signal-amber" r="5"><animateMotion dur="5.8s" begin="1.25s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M110 28 C160 95 360 84 500 124"/></circle><circle class="flow-signal flow-signal-blue" r="5"><animateMotion dur="5.8s" begin="2.7s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M500 28 C500 68 500 88 500 124"/></circle><circle class="flow-signal flow-signal-amber" r="5"><animateMotion dur="5.8s" begin="4.1s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M890 28 C840 95 640 84 500 124"/></circle></svg><div class="system-flow-sources"><span class="system-node system-node-source">Automation</span><span class="system-node system-node-source">AI agents</span><span class="system-node system-node-source">Software</span></div><span class="system-node system-node-output">One connected system</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Technology is rarely the real problem</span><h2>Work slows down when processes, people, and tools operate separately.</h2><p>We do not recommend software because it is trending. We look for repeated work, missing information, and decisions that arrive too late.</p></div><div class="home-grid">{problems.map(([title,body],i)=><article class="interactive-card"><div class="card-icon">0{i+1}</div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section section-alt"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Solutions</span><h2>Technology tied to a clear operational outcome.</h2><p>Start with one targeted improvement or build a system in phases. We choose the technology after understanding the process.</p></div><div class="home-grid">{solutions.map(([title,body,href])=><a class="interactive-card" href={href}><div class="card-icon dark-icon">↗</div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p><span class="card-link">Explore solution →</span></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section section-dark"><div class="container assessment-panel"><div class="assessment-copy"><span class="eyebrow dark">Start with clarity</span><h2>An assessment that also demonstrates what we can build.</h2><p>Our voice agent runs a structured 12–15 minute discovery session. You receive three preliminary opportunities, expected impact, and a clear next step.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary button-lg" href="/en/assessment/now">Start my assessment now</a><a class="button button-dark-outline" href="/en/assessment/schedule">Schedule my assessment</a></div></div><div class="voice-card"><div class="voice-title"><span>◉</span><div>Voice-guided assessment<br/><small>12–15 min · ES / EN</small></div></div><ul><li>Understands your current process</li><li>Finds repetitive work</li><li>Prioritizes opportunities</li><li>Delivers an immediate summary</li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">How we work</span><h2>Understand first. Design second. Then implement.</h2></div><div class="steps">{steps.map(([n,t,p])=><article class="step"><span class="step-number">{n}</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section section-alt"><div class="container founder"><img src="/team/julio-marte.jpeg" alt="Julio Alberto Marte Balbuena" loading="lazy"/><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Direct accountability</span><h2>A technology firm with founder-level attention.</h2><p>Julio leads assessments, solution design, and each client relationship. QuisqueyaTech works from the Dominican Republic with companies at home and abroad.</p><p class="founder-name"><strong>Julio Alberto Marte Balbuena</strong><br/>Founder and automation & AI consultant</p><div><a class="button button-outline" href="/en/about">Learn more</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section resources-cta"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Resources</span><h2>Resources for better technology decisions</h2><p>Practical guidance on automation, AI agents, and systems integration—without empty trends or inflated promises.</p><div><a class="button button-outline" href="/en/recursos">View resources</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-dark signature-cta"><div class="container"><h2>Find where technology can create the greatest impact.</h2><p>Complete the assessment now or reserve a time that works for you.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary button-lg" href="/en/assessment/now">Start my assessment now</a><a class="button button-dark-outline" href="/en/assessment/schedule">Schedule my assessment</a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>